# Service Layer Rules
- Locate all business logic inside `src/services/`.
- Never access `req` or `res` objects directly within service files.
- When an entity is not found, throw a custom `NotFoundError`:
  ```javascript
  if (!device) {
    throw new NotFoundError(`Device with ID ${id} not found`);
  }